![Dashboard](your-image-name.png)

## 📌 Key Insights

* Total Transactions: 9971
* Total Quantity Sold: 14K
* Total Revenue: 46.37K
* Total Profit: 16.23K

## 🔍 Features

* Year and Month filters
* Branch-wise revenue analysis
* Product category insights
* City-wise revenue breakdown

## 🛠 Tools Used

* Power BI
* Data Visualization

